<title>SPAIN: Spain's February jobless rises to 14.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's February jobless rises to 14.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	     FEB 97    JAN 97	FEB 96</p>
<p> Total (million)	    2.26	 2.26	 2.43</p>
<p> Change on month	  +6,223    +40,406     +5,152</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	  14.11	14.07	15.44</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
